# Gmail SMTP Configuration
# 1. Host: smtp.gmail.com
# 2. Port: 465 (SSL)
# 3. Secure: ssl
# 4. Username: Your Gmail ID
# 5. Password: Your 16-character Google App Password (NOT your normal password)
